      "updated": 1794000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Events and the directory are public Ligue content. Registrations are the patient's own data: the app only records that they registered\nwith the organizer. A caregiver sees whether the patient registered when Events is shared (ObserveCareSection), and confirms one for them with US-42.",
      "originalText": "Events and the directory are public Ligue content. Registrations are the patient's own data: the app only records that they registered\nwith the organizer. A caregiver sees whether the patient registered when Events is shared (ObserveCareSection), and confirms one for them with US-42.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
